Description: ROS 2 OpenVINO toolkit nodes, launch and parameter files
 Pipeline and service nodes of the ROS 2 OpenVINO toolkit together with their
 launch files, YAML pipeline configurations, label files and sample images.
 Installing this package installs the complete toolkit.
 .
 The OpenVINO models are not part of the package. Download them with
 "ros2 run openvino_node download_models.sh".
